# Vosk acoustic model — large (~68MB) binary blob, kept local only.
# To restore: download vosk-model-small-en-us, unzip its CONTENTS into app/src/main/assets/model/,
# then create app/src/main/assets/model/uuid (any short string) — Vosk's StorageService.unpack
# REQUIRES a uuid file or it hangs silently on "Loading Speech Engine...".
app/src/main/assets/model/
